ull,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["辰噌拉麵\n\n20260704週六晚上17:36初訪免排隊。\n\n來客狀況：店內已有兩人\n點餐方式：畫單點餐\n支付方式：可電子支付/現金\n發票載具：免統一發票\n洗手間：有。\n飲用水：有，自取。\n人員配置：一人顧店。有戴頭巾和口罩給個讚。\n座位配置：吧檯座位14張。\n置物空間：有抽屜與掛鉤、衣架。\n\n當日選擇餐點：\n香辣肉臊豚骨拉麵250\n青檸味噌雞清拉麵260\n\n湯：可以調整鹹度。不會太濃太鹹，湯溫還蠻夠的。個人比較喜歡香辣肉臊，味噌的鹹味會加乘，怕鹹的湯可以鹹度選淡。店裡有很多熬湯的大鍋，應該是真的有愛的拉麵店。\n麵：可選硬度，麵是比較滑順的麵條。可免費加麵，有工作證、學生證可免費加白飯。\n配料：一片五花叉燒，超好吃。兩小片雞胸略微普通。筍乾和糖心蛋中規中矩，表現也不錯啦。\n佐料：調味料有七味粉、胡椒粉等可自取。\n心得備注：蠻好吃的，價格實惠，建議加點五花叉燒。如果剛好到附近會回訪。",null,[0,29]]]],[null,1783169765000000,1783169765000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfSkVZY1BaMUl4NWo5bkJFYWFGM1pldw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfSkVZY1BaMUl4NWo5bkJFYWFGM1pldxoSQ2dzSTVZV2swZ1lRX2Z2N0VR\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiqpaL4xdKWAxX0gK8BHePiNG8Q_2MIdCgN"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6971284578476098076/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTV0ZWVVVubFNhbWhxVW14YWVtSlVSbXBhUmtwTFZGWTVabU13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6971284578476098076/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTV0ZWVVVubFNhbWhxVW14YWVtSlVSbXBhUmtwTFZGWTVabU13UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6971284578476098076/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTV0ZWVVVubFNhbWhxVW14YWVtSlVSbXBhUmtwTFZGWTVabU13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6971284578476098076/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTV0ZWVVVubFNhbWhxVW14YWVtSlVSbXBhUmtwTFZGWTVabU13UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6971284578476098076/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTV0ZWVVVubFNhbWhxVW14YWVtSlVSbXBhUmtwTFZGWTVabU13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6971284578476098076/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhTV0ZWVVVubFNhbWhxVW14YWVtSlVSbXBhUmtwTFZGWTVabU13UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的五星好評",